{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1493619-aeon-darkness-revealed-chronicle-to-2e","id":1493619,"title":"[Aeon] Darkness Revealed chronicle to 2E","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-23T22:46:58-07:00","id":1493619,"title":"[Aeon] Darkness Revealed chronicle to 2E","content":"<b>Trinity: Darkness Revealed</b> ( <b>DR</b> in this topic ) was 1E Aeon official chronicle, based on 3 published adventure books. <b>OpCast</b> done it's 'how usable for 2E <b>Trinity</b>' reviews lately.<br /> <br /> <b>OpCast 1E DR reviews</b><br /> <b><a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-xabex-153b431c\" target=\"_blank\">1 - </a><a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-xabex-153b431c\" target=\"_blank\">Descent into Darkness</a></b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-qxsfs-17d30292\" target=\"_blank\"><b>2 - Through Shadow</b><br /> </a><a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-pdupa-19e1a30e?utm_campaign=w_share_ep&amp;utm_medium=dlink&amp;utm_source=w_share\" target=\"_blank\"><b>3 - </b></a><a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-pdupa-19e1a30e?utm_campaign=w_share_ep&amp;utm_medium=dlink&amp;utm_source=w_share\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Ascent to Light</b></a><br /> <br /> I'm just wonder - <b>How can we 'fix' them for 2E, to be more in tone of modern game edition? </b>I mark that I'm not against '<i>Psi Orders got dark secrets'</i> theme - maybe just trim a bit of base feel of adventures, to me much less so?<br /> <br /> Here are links to DriveThruRPG PDFs of them:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/3064/Trinity-Darkness-Revealed-1-Descent-into-Darkness\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...-into-Darkness</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/3065/Trinity-Darkness-Revealed-2-Passage-Through-Shadow\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...Through-Shadow</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/3066/Trinity-Darkness-Revealed-3-Ascent-into-Light\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...ent-into-Light</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-28-2023, 01:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-24T04:29:58-07:00","id":1493624,"title":"","content":"My suggestion is to make it less high rank, instead of the upper echelon, make them intermediate managers with their own selfish agendas.<br /> <br /> In the end, instead of debunking the psi orders, you may be helping them to clean their numbers, improve their inner communication, etc. by showing the bad apples in the basket.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-31T01:36:38-07:00","id":1507035,"title":"","content":"Hi!,<br /> <br /> I started that campaign 2021 -<br /> <br /> Here is my original tread, with similiar questions: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-%C3%A6on/1440007-%C3%A6on-adapting-descent-into-darkness-for-tc-%C3%A6on\">https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/...or-tc-%C3%A6on</a><br /> <br /> Similiar to Mateuz idea. <br /> <br /> I keep it lighter and more a &quot;free the orders of corruption&quot;. The enemies in the module are more presented as misguided or even coerced into their wrong doing, than actual beeing sociopaths and &quot;Dr. Mengele&quot; stand ins.<br /> You can ask me anything how i handled specific parts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T10:42:54-07:00","id":1508652,"title":"","content":"So I ended <b>Assassins</b> chronicle, I'm slowly going for this <b>Aeon</b> <b>Darkness Revealed</b> beast. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> My first and foremost question is this - Can I semi-logicly use <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/317043/Quantum-Entanglement-A-Jumpstart-for-Trinity-Continuum-Aeon\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Quantum Entanglement </b>Jumpstart</a> to start this chronicle, as introduction to <b>Descent </b><b>Into Darkness</b> scenario? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> I want to start with Jumpstart as easier stracture for learning mechanics for me and players before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-24-2023, 04:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T14:46:50-07:00","id":1508670,"title":"","content":"As far as I recall the 1e stories are not hard to fit in any campaign. And Quantum Entanglement is pretty basic in terms of what gets into play. You are not going to have any kind of difficulty to include it.<br /> <br /> it will be more complex to adapt the darkness of the old setting to TC than to find hooks to hang them together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-23T23:57:20-07:00","id":1509456,"title":"","content":"Starting to read <b>Darkness Revealed 1: Descent into Darkness</b>... ( <b>DiD</b> from now on )<br /> <br /> From what I read, adventure takes place in year 2120 - where <b>Aeon</b> 2E takes place in 2123, same year Esperanza fell on Earth. In <b>Aeon</b> 1E Esperanza fell in 2120? Or did it not fell yet even? Any bigger setting differences are in 1E moved to 2120? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> Or can I simply use <b>DiD</b> and whole <b>Darkness Revealed </b>materials as it is, simply to <b>move them from 2123 to 2120 in plot</b>, without much repercussions? \ud83e\udd14<br /> \u200b<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1493619-aeon-darkness-revealed-chronicle-to-2e?p=1508670#post1508670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It will be more complex to adapt the darkness of the old setting to TC than to find hooks to hang them together.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>DiD</b> start with Neptune Foundation asking PCs to help with Aesculapians - I can easily make start of <b>Quantum Entalgment</b> that Aeon Trinity ask PCs from various Orders to see in to deaths in Luna Park - and then Aeon Trinity just recommend them to go after Aesculapians. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-24-2023, 01:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-24T21:33:39-07:00","id":1509552,"title":"","content":"On fan Discord, Travis pointed main change to DiD you need to make for 2E<br /> <br /> <i>You should be able to swap in the appropriate Metacorp from <b>Mission Statements, p. 49 </b>pretty easily. You might need to tweak some of the plot beats from DR (it's been a bit, but for example <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Huang-Marr Biotechnics is *way* less sloppy and careless than the H-M Conspiracy as presented in DR (like leaving corpses lying about and whatnot is probably not a flaw they'd have)|| </div></div> </div> </div></i>\u200b<br /> <i>Mostly, you'll be dealing with matters of tone both in the events, but also in public and private reaction to those events.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-25-2023, 01:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-24T21:37:21-07:00","id":1509553,"title":"","content":"DR takes place in 2120 of 1E. Aeon 2E takes place in 2123, with 2120 taking Esperanza failing there. I will probably just use Trinity 2E timeline in 2120, just set the game few weeks after Esperanza fall - and most important events we will have. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-22T02:43:58-07:00","id":1515838,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri Light\">Descent into Darkness \u2013 Proposed changes between 1E and 2E \u2013 based on Mission Statements</span></b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1305_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1305\" data-vbnamecard=\"1305\">maekkel</a> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> Could you look if those sounds good?</span><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Beaulac Clinic</b> \u2013 was Aesculaipan Order\u2019s base on Luna, but was sold last year ( 2119 ) to <b>Huang-Marr Biotechnics. </b>Beaulac Clinic is in Wroc\u0142aw district of Luna. ( yay, Poland\u2019s eater eggs <span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI Emoji\">\ud83d\ude0b</span>) </span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/ Maybe Aescuplainas are having administrative or finance problems? \ud83e\udd14 /</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><i>Dr. Jerzy Grabowski</i></b> is now <b>Huang-Marr </b>worker, previous non-psion member of Aesculapian. He was bought out in 2115 when H-M was created. ( it\u2019s very funny how my Text to Speech app read his clearly Polish name. 'Gery Gabowky' \ud83d\ude02 )</span></li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-23-2023, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-29T09:11:00-07:00","id":1516659,"title":"","content":"On whole idea of connecting <b>Quantum Entanglement</b> with 1E <b>Descent into Darkness</b> chronicle - Travis L. proposed on fan Discord to simply make that Rochevaunt's actions in <i><b>Beaulac Clinic</b></i>\u200b were based on his plans to defect to <b>Huang-Marr Biotechnics</b> - and turn on the ethics of Aesculapians he is (now) member of.\u200b Or to move whole <b>Clinic </b>parts to Boltzman Crater.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-23T06:50:10-07:00","id":1523022,"title":"","content":"<b>Descent Into Darkness - Remains of the Dead</b> <i><b>- I wonder how to run Boltzman Crater / Cantor Station complex</b></i>? Making it full defense alive secret lab for Huang-Marr ( From <b>Mission Statement</b>s ) - or totally dead complex after Aberrants attacks ( From 1E <b>Decent Into Darkness</b>)? \ud83e\udd14 Both solutions have Pros and Cons... <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1305_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1305\" data-vbnamecard=\"1305\">maekkel</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT : Thinking more about it - sneaking to secret corporate reaserch lab of H-M Corp is simply more interesting to watching empty Cantor Station - so we will go with H-M secret lab breach. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-24-2023, 08:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-16T03:48:04-07:00","id":1524134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1493619-aeon-darkness-revealed-chronicle-to-2e?p=1515838#post1515838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri Light\">Descent into Darkness \u2013 Proposed changes between 1E and 2E \u2013 based on Mission Statements</span></b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1305_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1305\" data-vbnamecard=\"1305\">maekkel</a> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> Could you look if those sounds good?</span><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Beaulac Clinic</b> \u2013 was Aesculaipan Order\u2019s base on Luna, but was sold last year ( 2119 ) to <b>Huang-Marr Biotechnics. </b>Beaulac Clinic is in Wroc\u0142aw district of Luna. ( yay, Poland\u2019s eater eggs <span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI Emoji\">\ud83d\ude0b</span>)<br /> Creating HMB - maybe helps out to not vilify the AO to much. </span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/ Maybe Aescuplainas are having administrative or finance problems? \ud83e\udd14 /</span><br /> <br /> - Settingwise, i adhered to Aeon 2E timeline, that the Esperanza crash just happend recently which helps the H-M-Conspiracy with covering up and why the Docs are incapable of looking into their corruption because they are preoccupied with Europe.\u200b Also the Docs clinic are quite independent and thus..</li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><i>Dr. Jerzy Grabowski</i></b> is now <b>Huang-Marr </b>worker, previous non-psion member of Aesculapian. He was bought out in 2115 when H-M was created. ( it\u2019s very funny how my Text to Speech app read his clearly Polish name. 'Gery Gabowky' \ud83d\ude02 )<br /> <br /> <br /> ... Jerzy had an easy time - forming the Beaulac Clinic to his vision. Because it was ne new shiny thing of the AO it got all the funding it requested. I made him a Doc with several Telepathy modes. </span></li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1493619-aeon-darkness-revealed-chronicle-to-2e?p=1515838#post1515838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri Light\">Descent into Darkness \u2013 Proposed changes between 1E and 2E \u2013 based on Mission Statements</span></b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Descent Into Darkness - Remains of the Dead</b> <i><b>- I wonder how to run Boltzman Crater / Cantor Station complex</b></i>? Making it full defense alive secret lab for Huang-Marr ( From <b>Mission Statement</b>s ) - or totally dead complex after Aberrants attacks ( From 1E <b>Decent Into Darkness</b>)? \ud83e\udd14 Both solutions have Pros and Cons... <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1305_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1305\" data-vbnamecard=\"1305\">maekkel</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT : Thinking more about it - sneaking to secret corporate reaserch lab of H-M Corp is simply more interesting to watching empty Cantor Station - so we will go with H-M secret lab breach. \ud83d\ude0e\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>I had Cantor dead - because i did not want to make this to much of a paper chase.<br /> Boltzman Crater - was full defense complex - because i wanted to introduce Option 8. To show that their is a psion clean up group. Also Luna is to much fun. (We had a lot of moon puns.)<br /> But if you want to rail gun the story you can make the place dead where Option 8 and / or an Abberrant already swiped the place almost clean recently. But I had 2 more or less combat centric PC's and i wanted them to give them some tme to shine.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-03T00:27:28-08:00","id":1531868,"title":"","content":"<b>Descent Into Darkness 3rd story - Downward Spiral - Mars modified</b> - In 2nd adventure ( <b>Depths of Madness </b>) my players explored <b>Haung-Marr</b> secret site, but they <b>did not confronted Willoms</b>. They just slipped away from site when getting incrementing data discs. By this, Willoms simply had time to run on normal speed and charter private spaceship. ( Probably Speed 4 as they are rich ) So they will be on Mars in 2 weeks, by Aeon spaceflight Speed table. My players willl probably do some things by few days on Luna, before heading to Mars. <b>What could Willoms do on Mars BEFORE PCs will catch up with them, in few days later?</b> Villains marriage is clearly not injured, so the do not need medical help on Mars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-08T07:06:39-07:00","id":1550839,"title":"","content":"You could probably drop Quantum Entanglement within the first couple of adventures of Darkness Revealed. For my part, you should probably run The Last Gasp as the first actual adventure since it kicks off Darkness Revealed: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/3553/trinity-hidden-agendas\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/prod...hidden-agendas</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}